Description: TPM-backed virtual FIDO2 authenticator with desktop confirmation
 Provides a virtual FIDO2 security key through Linux UHID, with TPM-backed
 signing keys, software CTAP PIN verification and desktop notification actions
 for user presence. Starts in the user's graphical session.
 .
 Experimental software: PIN verification is not enforced by TPM hardware.
